# A song sent in a chat by alice's other device (peer createfiles): opened from its card, the preview's small player in
# the page's colours (AudioViewer): its name, play, where it is going on as it plays, read through the core a part at a
# time (station.file.part). Back closes it.
timeout 60000
until 端到端测试
log do: peer createfiles 一段录音 {T} post:收到录音 {T} -- e2e-tune.m4a
timeout 180000
until 一段录音 {T}
timeout 60000
tap 一段录音 {T}
until e2e-tune.m4a
tap e2e-tune.m4a
# (a song playing moves on its own, never settled: what is looked at and done while it plays is `now`)
now until / 0:
now until 0:02 /
now shot 1-playing
now back
shot 2-chat
